abstract: >-
  RSMS defines the universal mathematical, methodological, computational,
  validation, versioning, and registry framework used by the Resolutive
  Science research program. Release-candidate status denotes specification
  maturity and does not imply empirical validation of Resolutive Physics.
keywords:
  - resolutive science
